    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n4735" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀλύσσω</span></b> , fut.<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ξω,</span>
		v. infr., (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀλύω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>to be uneasy, restless,</i>
			pres. only <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				22.70
			</span></i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. περὶ θυμῷ</span>: fut.,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀλύξει τε καὶ ῥίψει ἑαυτήν</span>
			<i>will be restless</i> . . , <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Mul.</u>
				1.2
			</span></i>: plpf.
			
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κραδίη ἀλάλυκτο φόβῳ</span>”
				<i>was disquieted,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Q.S.
					14.24
				</span></i>
			.</div>
